Author: kitchen-bot <kitchen-bot@margherita-pizza.internal>
Date:   Mon Sep 14 15:47:29 2026 +0800

    fix(dough-service): call mozzarella-service API instead of reading its table directly

    checkSauceAndCheeseReady() in dough-service opened a direct SQL
    connection to mozzarella-service's cold-chain table and read
    temperature_celsius rows itself, bypassing mozzarella-service's own
    alerting and cache-invalidation logic. A schema change in
    mozzarella-service silently broke dough-service's readiness check
    with no compile-time signal. Sauce readiness already goes through
    tomato-sauce-api's HTTP status endpoint; cheese readiness now goes
    through mozzarella-service's HTTP client the same way, and the direct
    database dependency is removed from dough-service.

